riot_username,riot_password,new_password,imap_email,imap_app_password,new_email,imap_host,imap_port,proxy_index,email_change_url,change_password
# One row per account. Fill required columns; leave optional ones blank.
#   riot_username      Riot login (username or account email)
#   riot_password      Current Riot password (used to log in)
#   new_password       New Riot password (required when change_password=1)
#   imap_email         Mailbox that receives Riot MFA/verify codes
#   imap_app_password  App-specific password for that mailbox (NOT the normal password)
#   new_email          Email address you want to change the account to
#   imap_host          (optional) IMAP server; blank = auto from the email domain
#   imap_port          (optional) default 993
#   proxy_index        (optional) Playwright only — ignored by Safari batch
#   email_change_url   (optional) post-login page; blank = account.riotgames.com
#   change_password    1 = change password AFTER email, 0 = skip password change
#                      (blank defaults to 1)
#
# Flow: login → change email → IMAP verify → (optional) change password → LOG OUT EVERYWHERE
#
# macOS Safari batch (usually no captcha):
#   ./run_safari_batch.sh data/tasks.csv
#   → success.txt         (ok accounts; password column is NEW when change_password=1)
#   → tasks.csv           (successful rows are removed automatically)
#   → failed.txt          (CSV rows you can paste back into tasks.csv to rerun)
#   → failed_reasons.txt  (username + reason + log path)
#
# Force skip password for the whole batch:
#   SKIP_PASSWORD_CHANGE=1 ./run_safari_mac.sh
#   (same as change_password=0 on every row)
#
# iCloud app passwords: appleid.apple.com > Sign-In and Security > App-Specific Passwords
# Gmail app passwords:  myaccount.google.com/apppasswords (requires 2FA)
example-login@icloud.com,OldRiotPassw0rd!,NewRiotPassw0rd!,codes-inbox@icloud.com,abcd-efgh-ijkl-mnop,my-new-email@gmail.com,,,,,1
example-no-pw-change@icloud.com,SamePassw0rd!,,codes-inbox@icloud.com,abcd-efgh-ijkl-mnop,another-new@gmail.com,,,,,0
